<title>FINLAND: GOOD PROFITABILITY OUTLOOK FOR FINNISH SMES - SURVEY.</title>
<headline>GOOD PROFITABILITY OUTLOOK FOR FINNISH SMES - SURVEY.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>An overwhelming majority of Finnish small and medium-sized enterprises expect their profitability to remain unchanged or improve further this year, the Bankers' Association said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>Referring to a survey of 1,000 SMEs, it said 95 percent of respondents expected unchanged or better profitability this year.</p>
</text>
